B.a5f=new A.hX("Eid al-Adha Mubarak","The greatest day in the sight of Allah. Takbir, sacrifice, family \u2014 and remember: it is neither the meat nor the blood that reaches Him, but your taqwa.","Sunan Ibn Majah 3126 \xb7 Quran 22:37")
B.a5h=new A.hX("Ashura is upon us","Fast the 9th with the 10th if you can \u2014 fasting Ashura expiates the year that passed.","Sahih Muslim 1162 \xb7 1134")
B.a5l=new A.hX("It\u2019s Jumu\u2019ah","The best day the sun rises upon. Today: read Surah al-Kahf, send many salawat upon the Prophet \ufdfa, and catch the hour in which dua is answered.","Sahih al-Bukhari 893 \xb7 Sahih Muslim 854 \xb7 Abu Dawud 1048")
B.a5n=new A.hX("Ramadan has arrived","The gates of Paradise are opened, the gates of the Fire are shut, and the devils are chained. Welcome, ya Ramadan.","Sahih al-Bukhari 1899 \u2014 excerpt")
B.a5o=new A.hX("Eid Mubarak","Eat before the prayer, take one road there and another home, and let the takbir fill the streets. Taqabbal Allahu minna wa minkum.","Sahih al-Bukhari 953 \xb7 986")
B.a5p=new A.hX("The Day of Arafah","For those not on Hajj: fasting today expiates the year before and the year after. And pour out dua \u2014 it is the best day of the year for it.","Sahih Muslim 1162 \xb7 Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 3585")
B.a5r=new A.hX("Tomorrow the White Days begin","The 13th, 14th and 15th \u2014 the nights of the full moon \u2014 the Prophet \ufdfa fasted them, and said three days of each month is like fasting a lifetime.",u.b)
