B.avw=new A.eA(["Makkah","The night of the departure","Quraysh had voted to kill him \u2014 one man from every clan, so the blood-price would crush his family. The Prophet \ufdfa slipped out while they watched his door.","Sahih al-Bukhari 3905"])
