B.avy=new A.eA(["The Road North","Suraqa and the changing of the earth","The rider chasing the bounty \u2014 a hundred camels \u2014 was thrown twice from his horse as the ground seized it. He asked for a letter of safety and rode home guarding the document he had come to kill for.","Sahih al-Bukhari 3905"])
